ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT FOR OPERATIONAL USE

This software is a challenge prototype for decision-support demonstration
purposes. It is not certified, qualified, or validated for launch authority,
flight safety, or any operational space-weather decision. The bundled model
artifacts were trained on synthetic data and their reported performance does
not establish real-world predictive validity. Do not use this software as a
basis for launch, scrub, or hold decisions.
